    "comment": {
      "comments": [
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12441997/comment/12783838",
          "id": "12783838",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=moqtada",
            "name": "moqtada",
            "key": "moqtada",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Tony Poppleton",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "The second solution would also mean that there is a risk this bug might resurface in the future, either in the same class or in another part of the library by the introduction of a Log.  So the \"static\" solution would be better in this respect.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=moqtada",
            "name": "moqtada",
            "key": "moqtada",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Tony Poppleton",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "created": "2009-11-30T20:46:42.610+0000",
          "updated": "2009-11-30T20:46:42.610+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12441997/comment/12783849",
          "id": "12783849",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=olegk",
            "name": "olegk",
            "key": "olegk",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Oleg Kalnichevski",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Berlin"
          },
          "body": "Tony,\n\nCould you please test the patch? You will need the latest SVN snapshot to apply it.\n\nOleg",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=olegk",
            "name": "olegk",
            "key": "olegk",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Oleg Kalnichevski",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Berlin"
          },
          "created": "2009-11-30T21:37:25.732+0000",
          "updated": "2009-11-30T21:37:25.732+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12441997/comment/12783874",
          "id": "12783874",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=olegk",
            "name": "olegk",
            "key": "olegk",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Oleg Kalnichevski",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Berlin"
          },
          "body": "I do not think that reverting back to using static logs would be such a good idea. We just need to make sure that no Log object lookups take place on critical execution paths. That is, there no Log objects should be created on a per request basis. Objects created in the course of request execution should be reusing Log object of the HttpClient instance.\n\nOleg",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=olegk",
            "name": "olegk",
            "key": "olegk",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Oleg Kalnichevski",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Berlin"
          },
          "created": "2009-11-30T22:09:48.180+0000",
          "updated": "2009-11-30T22:09:48.180+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12441997/comment/12783964",
          "id": "12783964",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=moqtada",
            "name": "moqtada",
            "key": "moqtada",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Tony Poppleton",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "The patch is for DefaultRequestDirector.java (revision 885491) and fails to apply properly (needs manual fixing) as the revision I just got from SVN is 885603.  Please advise.\n\nWhen I ran my manually patched version there was a performance improvement on a small number of benchmarks I ran (I am seeing upto 10% improvement in my threads dealing with responses).",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=moqtada",
            "name": "moqtada",
            "key": "moqtada",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Tony Poppleton",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "created": "2009-12-01T00:32:10.064+0000",
          "updated": "2009-12-01T00:32:10.064+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12441997/comment/12783973",
          "id": "12783973",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=moqtada",
            "name": "moqtada",
            "key": "moqtada",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Tony Poppleton",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "Oops regarding the last comment - I had checked out the 4.0 tag rather than the trunk which is why the patch didn't apply smoothly...",
